      "settings": {
        "prefix": "Our Story",
        "title": "About Us",
        "text_1": "We create jewellery that feels as good as it looks. Designed with a focus on comfort, durability, and everyday wear, each piece is crafted using skin-safe materials that are gentle and reliable for daily use.",
